---
// PaymentPreAnalysisModal.astro - Solid, High-Contrast Bilingual Pre-Analysis Warning Modal
---

<div
  id="payment-pre-analysis-modal"
  class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md hidden"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="payment-modal-title"
>
  <div class="relative w-full max-w-xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1b18] border-2 border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-200">
    
    <!-- Modal Header -->
    <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 flex items-center justify-between bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-900/90">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-base font-bold shadow-sm">
          ⚠️
        </span>
        <h3 id="payment-modal-title" class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 font-semibold tracking-tight">
          Payment Verification Notice
        </h3>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="close-payment-modal-btn"
        class="text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-700 dark:hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-200 dark:hover:bg-stone-800"
        aria-label="Close modal"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal Body (Internally Scrollable) -->
    <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1b18]">
      
      <!-- English Section -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/80 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-2 border-amber-400/80 dark:border-amber-600 space-y-2 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>🚨 IMPORTANT PAYMENT VERIFICATION</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 font-medium text-sm leading-snug">
          If a payment is not showing up in your UPI App, check your <span class="bg-amber-200/70 dark:bg-amber-900/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold text-stone-950 dark:text-amber-100 underline decoration-amber-500 underline-offset-2">Bank Statement through your official Bank App or directly with your Bank</span>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          This is the most reliable and legitimate way to verify whether the payment was actually received. <strong>Do not release goods, services, refunds, or money based only on a payment screenshot.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Hindi Section -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-orange-50/80 dark:bg-orange-950/40 border-2 border-orange-400/80 dark:border-orange-600 space-y-2 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>🚨 महत्वपूर्ण भुगतान सत्यापन सूचना</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 font-medium text-sm leading-snug">
          अगर कोई भुगतान आपके UPI ऐप में दिखाई नहीं दे रहा है, तो <span class="bg-orange-200/70 dark:bg-orange-900/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold text-stone-950 dark:text-orange-100 underline decoration-orange-500 underline-offset-2">अपने आधिकारिक बैंक ऐप से Bank Statement चेक करें या सीधे अपने बैंक से पुष्टि करें</span>।
        </p>
        <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          यह पता करने का सबसे भरोसेमंद और वैध तरीका है कि भुगतान वास्तव में आपके खाते में आया है या नहीं। <strong>केवल Payment Screenshot देखकर सामान, सेवा, Refund या पैसे जारी न करें।</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Tips -->
      <div class="text-xs text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 space-y-1.5 pt-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span>Screen checking detects graphic tampering, but cannot verify actual bank settlement.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span>100% Client-Side. Your financial screenshots never leave your device.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal Footer -->
    <div class="px-6 py-4 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-900/90 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-end gap-3">
      <button
        type="button"
        id="dismiss-payment-modal-btn"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-stone-900 dark:hover:text-white font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-200 dark:hover:bg-stone-800"
      >
        Cancel
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="accept-payment-modal-btn"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto btn-primary bg-[#cc785c] hover:bg-[#b5654b] text-white text-xs px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md font-semibold cursor-pointer rounded-xl transition-all"
      >
        <span>I Understand & Continue to Analysis</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
